LZ4 (Yann Collet, BSD-2-Clause) and LZAV (Aleksey Vaneev, MIT), used by `-m6`/`-m7`
and `-ma:lz4`/`-ma:lzav`, come embedded in zpaq-std.cpp from zpaqfranz.

The ZPAQL decoders that travel in `-ma` blocks are zpaq-std's own, except the LZMA
decoder at the core of ZPAQLZMA and ZPAQFLZMA2, by Kaido Orav (kaitz), from zpaqf
(public domain; compressors/zpaqlzma/LICENSE).
